WEBVTT

00:00:01.225 --> 00:00:17.792
Anna and the Fighter by Elizabeth Laird.

00:00:17.852 --> 00:00:33.856
Anna did not sleep all night.

00:00:33.916 --> 00:00:35.547
She was excited.

00:00:35.607 --> 00:00:38.608
Early in the morning, her father called her.

00:00:38.668 --> 00:00:40.109
Come on, Anna.

00:00:40.169 --> 00:00:41.640
It's time to get up.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.432
It's a long way to the station.

00:00:44.491 --> 00:00:47.743
Anna got dressed and she was soon ready.

00:00:47.803 --> 00:00:50.164
She did not eat any breakfast.

00:00:50.224 --> 00:00:51.685
She was nervous.

00:00:51.745 --> 00:00:55.016
She was going to visit her aunt in Nara.

00:00:55.076 --> 00:00:59.153
She was going alone in a train for the first time.

00:00:59.213 --> 00:01:04.380
Anna and her father left the village and began to walk to the station.

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:06.481
It was a long way.

00:01:06.541 --> 00:01:13.644
They reached the station at midday.

00:01:13.704 --> 00:01:19.697
Soon the train came.

00:01:19.757 --> 00:01:21.628
It was nearly empty.

00:01:21.688 --> 00:01:23.219
Anna got in.

00:01:23.279 --> 00:01:25.050
She was frightened.

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:28.484
It was her first journey away from home.

00:01:28.544 --> 00:01:31.288
Your aunt will meet you at Nara.

00:01:31.348 --> 00:01:32.740
Her father said.

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:34.801
Be careful now, Anna.

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:42.356
Don't talk to any strangers.

00:01:42.416 --> 00:01:50.401
The train started suddenly.

00:01:50.461 --> 00:01:53.535
Soon it was going fast.

00:01:53.595 --> 00:01:55.508
Anna watched her father.

00:01:55.568 --> 00:02:01.814
He looked smaller and smaller, then he disappeared.

00:02:01.874 --> 00:02:06.346
The train journey was very long.

00:02:06.406 --> 00:02:08.578
Anna looked out of the window.

00:02:08.638 --> 00:02:13.912
The fields, trees, villages and animals rushed past.

00:02:13.972 --> 00:02:18.156
After a long time, she began to feel sleepy.

00:02:18.216 --> 00:02:20.498
She was very tired.

00:02:20.558 --> 00:02:23.681
Slowly, she fell asleep.

00:02:23.741 --> 00:02:25.943
Later Anna woke up.

00:02:26.003 --> 00:02:28.044
It was dark outside.

00:02:28.104 --> 00:02:30.836
She felt small and lost.

00:02:30.896 --> 00:02:34.608
She was a long way from her village and her father.

00:02:34.668 --> 00:02:38.010
There was a man in the carriage with her now.

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:43.282
He had an ugly face and he was very big and strong.

00:02:43.342 --> 00:02:45.894
His hair was very short.

00:02:45.954 --> 00:02:49.306
He looked bad and dangerous.

00:02:49.366 --> 00:02:52.030
The man smiled at Anna.

00:02:52.090 --> 00:02:54.505
Hello, he said.

00:02:54.565 --> 00:02:56.876
You're awake now, are you?

00:02:56.936 --> 00:02:58.997
Where are you going?

00:02:59.057 --> 00:03:01.848
Anna remembered her father's words.

00:03:01.908 --> 00:03:04.850
She did not say anything.

00:03:04.909 --> 00:03:07.230
Are you going to Polona?

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:08.811
Asked the man.

00:03:08.871 --> 00:03:10.952
Anna was surprised.

00:03:11.012 --> 00:03:14.324
No, to Nara, she said.

00:03:14.384 --> 00:03:16.985
Nara, said the man.

00:03:17.045 --> 00:03:20.526
But we passed Nara two hours ago.

00:03:20.586 --> 00:03:23.446
You were asleep.

00:03:23.506 --> 00:03:26.848
Anna wanted to cry.

00:03:26.908 --> 00:03:29.500
She sat very still.

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:33.293
It was warm in the carriage, but Anna felt cold.

00:03:33.352 --> 00:03:36.104
We passed, Nara?

00:03:36.164 --> 00:03:37.356
She asked.

00:03:37.415 --> 00:03:40.078
Yes, said the man.

00:03:40.138 --> 00:03:43.220
Anna thought of the journey back to Nara.

00:03:43.279 --> 00:03:45.442
How much did it cost?

00:03:45.502 --> 00:03:47.620
She did not have any money.

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:51.020
She thought of her aunt at an error station.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:53.852
Don't worry, said the man.

00:03:53.912 --> 00:03:55.233
I'll help you.

00:03:55.292 --> 00:03:56.864
What's your name?

00:03:56.924 --> 00:03:59.316
Anna, she said.

00:03:59.376 --> 00:04:02.548
My name is Sam, said the man.

00:04:02.608 --> 00:04:05.360
You can trust me, Anna.

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:08.252
Anna looked at Sam again.

00:04:08.312 --> 00:04:10.904
He was very ugly.

00:04:10.964 --> 00:04:16.342
He had a long scar on his face, and he looked dangerous.

00:04:16.402 --> 00:04:19.438
But he seemed kind.

00:04:19.498 --> 00:04:22.560
Was he good or bad?

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:24.782
Anna did not know.

00:04:24.842 --> 00:04:27.585
The train began to slow down.

00:04:27.645 --> 00:04:30.488
Sam got up and looked out of the window.

00:04:30.548 --> 00:04:33.870
Anna saw a newspaper on Sam's seat.

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:36.874
There was a photograph on the back page.

00:04:36.934 --> 00:04:39.566
It was Sam's photograph.

00:04:39.626 --> 00:04:43.097
Above the photograph was a headline.

00:04:43.157 --> 00:04:47.848
This man is a dangerous fighter.

00:04:47.907 --> 00:04:50.050
Now Anna was sure.

00:04:50.109 --> 00:04:54.432
Sam was a bad man, and dangerous too.

00:04:54.492 --> 00:04:56.314
He was a criminal.

00:04:56.374 --> 00:04:58.576
Anna must be careful.

00:04:58.636 --> 00:05:01.648
She must get away from him quickly.

00:05:01.708 --> 00:05:03.799
Sam left the window.

00:05:03.859 --> 00:05:07.392
We're coming into Polona now, he said.

00:05:07.452 --> 00:05:08.802
Stay with me.

00:05:08.862 --> 00:05:10.430
I'll help you.

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:12.429
The train stopped.

00:05:12.489 --> 00:05:15.351
Anna jumped up and ran to the door.

00:05:15.411 --> 00:05:17.522
She wanted to run away.

00:05:17.582 --> 00:05:19.874
The door was very heavy.

00:05:19.934 --> 00:05:21.926
She could not open it.

00:05:21.986 --> 00:05:24.858
Sam was standing behind her.

00:05:24.917 --> 00:05:29.931
I'll open it, he said.

00:05:29.991 --> 00:05:36.596
At the station exit, Anna was stopped.

00:05:36.656 --> 00:05:38.957
Where's your ticket?

00:05:39.017 --> 00:05:41.848
This ticket is for Nara.

00:05:41.908 --> 00:05:43.869
I fell asleep.

00:05:43.929 --> 00:05:46.090
I passed Nara.

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:48.731
I haven't got any money.

00:05:48.791 --> 00:05:50.202
I'll pay.

00:05:50.262 --> 00:05:51.652
Said a voice.

00:05:51.712 --> 00:05:53.443
It was Sam.

00:05:53.503 --> 00:05:55.764
Thank you, sir.

00:05:55.823 --> 00:06:00.846
Come with me, Anna.

00:06:00.906 --> 00:06:07.818
Anna wanted to run away, but she was frightened of Sam.

00:06:07.878 --> 00:06:10.588
She was tired and lost.

00:06:10.648 --> 00:06:12.989
Polona was a big town.

00:06:13.049 --> 00:06:15.750
Anna did not know anybody there.

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:18.001
Sam called a taxi.

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:19.531
Get in, Anna?

00:06:19.591 --> 00:06:20.722
He said.

00:06:20.782 --> 00:06:22.502
Anna got in.

00:06:22.562 --> 00:06:24.503
The Boxer Hotel.

00:06:24.563 --> 00:06:26.554
Sam said to the driver.

00:06:26.614 --> 00:06:29.184
The taxi went a long way.

00:06:29.244 --> 00:06:32.496
The streets of Polona were wide and busy.

00:06:32.556 --> 00:06:36.789
There were lots of cars and shops and people.

00:06:36.849 --> 00:06:42.403
The taxi turned into a small, dark street and stopped.

00:06:42.462 --> 00:06:45.574
Sam got out and paid the taxi driver.

00:06:45.633 --> 00:06:48.624
Anna looked up and down the street.

00:06:48.684 --> 00:06:51.856
Come on, Anna, said Sam.

00:06:51.915 --> 00:06:54.040
Anna could not run away.

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:56.596
She was weak and slow.

00:06:56.655 --> 00:06:59.248
Sam was big and strong.

00:06:59.308 --> 00:07:02.610
She followed Sam into the hotel.

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:05.723
There was a cafe inside the hotel.

00:07:05.783 --> 00:07:08.194
It did not look very clean.

00:07:08.254 --> 00:07:11.298
Two men were drinking and playing cards.

00:07:11.358 --> 00:07:13.278
They saw Sam.

00:07:13.338 --> 00:07:17.992
One of them said, hello Sam, come and have a drink.

00:07:18.052 --> 00:07:20.122
Who's the pretty girl?

00:07:20.182 --> 00:07:23.482
Sam took off his coat and sat down.

00:07:23.542 --> 00:07:24.914
Hello, Tino.

00:07:24.974 --> 00:07:26.124
Hello, Bubs.

00:07:26.184 --> 00:07:28.537
He said, this is Anna.

00:07:28.596 --> 00:07:30.198
She's lost.

00:07:30.258 --> 00:07:33.380
The man looked at Anna and laughed.

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:36.542
Lost is she, said Tino.

00:07:36.602 --> 00:07:38.174
Poor Anna.

00:07:38.234 --> 00:07:40.536
And you're a lucky man, Sam.

00:07:40.596 --> 00:07:43.355
Have a drink.

00:07:43.415 --> 00:07:47.124
Sam gave Anna a chair.

00:07:47.184 --> 00:07:48.836
She sat down.

00:07:48.895 --> 00:07:50.737
She looked at the men.

00:07:50.797 --> 00:07:53.038
Tino had a mustache.

00:07:53.098 --> 00:07:55.960
Bobs did not have any front teeth.

00:07:56.020 --> 00:07:58.382
They looked tough.

00:07:58.442 --> 00:08:00.394
The men were drinking.

00:08:00.453 --> 00:08:02.956
Tino gave Anna a glass.

00:08:03.016 --> 00:08:04.656
Come on, Anna.

00:08:04.716 --> 00:08:05.502
He said.

00:08:05.562 --> 00:08:07.698
Drink some wine!"

00:08:07.758 --> 00:08:10.131
Anna pushed the glass away.

00:08:10.190 --> 00:08:14.584
She thought, I mustn't eat or drink anything.

00:08:14.644 --> 00:08:17.046
These men will give me a drug.

00:08:17.106 --> 00:08:19.298
Then I will fall asleep.

00:08:19.358 --> 00:08:21.590
Sam called the waiter.

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:24.202
Bring some dinner, he said.

00:08:24.262 --> 00:08:26.736
Bring some good hot food.

00:08:26.796 --> 00:08:29.382
The waiter came with the food.

00:08:29.442 --> 00:08:33.753
Bob's put some of the food on a plate and gave it to Anna.

00:08:33.813 --> 00:08:36.576
It looked good and smelled delicious.

00:08:36.636 --> 00:08:40.106
Anna forgot about drugs and began to eat.

00:08:40.167 --> 00:08:43.170
She ate quickly and finished everything.

00:08:43.230 --> 00:08:45.262
She put her spoon down.

00:08:45.322 --> 00:08:47.324
The men were looking at her.

00:08:47.384 --> 00:08:48.976
They laughed.

00:08:49.036 --> 00:08:51.760
Anna was very frightened again.

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:54.532
Come on, Anna, said Sam.

00:08:54.592 --> 00:08:55.814
You're tired.

00:08:55.874 --> 00:08:57.771
You must go to bed now.

00:08:57.831 --> 00:08:59.658
He took her arm.

00:08:59.718 --> 00:09:03.091
Lock her door, Sam, said Tino.

00:09:03.151 --> 00:09:05.684
They're a bad man in Polona.

00:09:05.744 --> 00:09:07.986
You must keep her safe.

00:09:08.046 --> 00:09:09.916
Bob's laughed.

00:09:09.976 --> 00:09:11.848
Good night, Anna.

00:09:11.908 --> 00:09:14.370
He said.

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:19.485
Sam took Anna upstairs and into a bedroom.

00:09:19.545 --> 00:09:22.128
Her heart was beating fast.

00:09:22.188 --> 00:09:23.738
Good night, Anna.

00:09:23.798 --> 00:09:25.099
Said Sam.

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:27.063
He smiled at her.

00:09:27.123 --> 00:09:28.776
Don't worry.

00:09:28.836 --> 00:09:30.856
You're safe here."

00:09:30.916 --> 00:09:33.488
Anna did not say anything.

00:09:33.548 --> 00:09:38.880
Sam seemed kind, but she remembered the newspaper.

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:44.022
Sam was dangerous, and his friends looked dangerous too.

00:09:44.082 --> 00:09:46.474
She must escape.

00:09:46.534 --> 00:09:50.125
Sam went out of the room and shut the door.

00:09:50.185 --> 00:09:53.266
He locked it and went downstairs.

00:09:53.326 --> 00:09:59.585
Anna sat on the bed and cried.

00:09:59.645 --> 00:10:05.934
downstairs the men drank and played cards.

00:10:05.994 --> 00:10:08.035
Anna heard their voices.

00:10:08.095 --> 00:10:10.046
They were laughing.

00:10:10.106 --> 00:10:19.582
After a long time, she fell asleep.

00:10:19.642 --> 00:10:27.176
Anna woke late.

00:10:27.236 --> 00:10:29.076
The sun was shining.

00:10:29.136 --> 00:10:31.110
She looked out of the window.

00:10:31.170 --> 00:10:34.342
The waiter was sitting outside in the street.

00:10:34.402 --> 00:10:38.244
He was smoking a cigarette and reading a newspaper.

00:10:38.304 --> 00:10:40.555
Anna looked round the room.

00:10:40.615 --> 00:10:42.136
It was dirty.

00:10:42.196 --> 00:10:44.997
There was some old paper on the floor.

00:10:45.057 --> 00:10:49.920
In one corner there was a small table with some things on it.

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:52.410
Anna had an idea.

00:10:52.470 --> 00:10:55.012
There was a byro on the table.

00:10:55.072 --> 00:10:59.680
She took the byro and picked up a piece of paper from the floor.

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:04.358
She wrote, please help me.

00:11:04.418 --> 00:11:07.999
I want to go to Nara.

00:11:08.059 --> 00:11:11.300
My aunt is waiting for me there.

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:14.181
I must escape from here.

00:11:14.241 --> 00:11:19.202
I have no money and no friends.

00:11:19.262 --> 00:11:22.799
Anna.

00:11:22.859 --> 00:11:27.086
She threw the note out of the window.

00:11:27.146 --> 00:11:29.227
The waiter picked it up.

00:11:29.287 --> 00:11:30.898
He read the note.

00:11:30.958 --> 00:11:33.288
He looked up and saw her.

00:11:33.348 --> 00:11:38.380
He smiled at her and went into the hotel.

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:43.452
Anna heard voices outside her room.

00:11:43.512 --> 00:11:45.793
Somebody unlocked the door.

00:11:45.853 --> 00:11:47.744
The waiter came in.

00:11:47.804 --> 00:11:51.107
There was somebody on the stairs behind him.

00:11:51.167 --> 00:11:54.251
It's a policeman, thought Anna.

00:11:54.311 --> 00:11:56.802
He's brought a policeman.

00:11:56.862 --> 00:11:58.935
She ran forward.

00:11:58.994 --> 00:12:00.936
It was Sam.

00:12:00.996 --> 00:12:04.468
He was holding her note in his hand.

00:12:04.528 --> 00:12:06.840
Good afternoon, Anna.

00:12:06.900 --> 00:12:08.220
Said Sam.

00:12:08.280 --> 00:12:10.302
You've slept very late.

00:12:10.362 --> 00:12:11.994
You must be hungry.

00:12:12.054 --> 00:12:14.075
Come and have some food.

00:12:14.135 --> 00:12:16.076
We're going soon.

00:12:16.136 --> 00:12:18.980
The waiter smiled at Sam.

00:12:19.041 --> 00:12:21.254
Anna understood.

00:12:21.314 --> 00:12:24.265
The waiter did not want to help her.

00:12:24.325 --> 00:12:27.576
He and Sam were friends.

00:12:27.636 --> 00:12:31.108
Anna went downstairs with Sam and the waiter.

00:12:31.168 --> 00:12:34.339
They gave her some food, but she was not hungry.

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:37.861
She did not eat or drink anything.

00:12:37.921 --> 00:12:41.082
Sam went outside into the street.

00:12:41.142 --> 00:12:43.196
Anna heard voices.

00:12:43.256 --> 00:12:45.689
Sam was talking to a man.

00:12:45.749 --> 00:12:47.620
What were they planning?

00:12:47.680 --> 00:12:50.161
Sam came inside again.

00:12:50.221 --> 00:12:53.112
Come on, Anna, we must go now.

00:12:53.172 --> 00:12:57.164
He said, a taxi was waiting outside.

00:12:57.224 --> 00:12:59.956
Anna and Sam got in.

00:13:00.016 --> 00:13:02.137
Where are we going?

00:13:02.197 --> 00:13:03.658
Anna asked.

00:13:03.718 --> 00:13:05.588
Sam looked at her.

00:13:05.648 --> 00:13:07.920
I'll take you to your aunt later.

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:12.775
He said, first I have an important job to do.

00:13:12.835 --> 00:13:14.868
Sam smiled.

00:13:14.928 --> 00:13:17.639
The smile twisted his face.

00:13:17.699 --> 00:13:20.740
He looked very ugly.

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:23.620
Soon the taxi stopped.

00:13:23.680 --> 00:13:25.910
Sam and Anna got out.

00:13:25.970 --> 00:13:28.501
They were outside a big building.

00:13:28.561 --> 00:13:32.622
There was a notice outside the building.

00:13:32.682 --> 00:13:49.138
Today, at three o'clock, Sam the fighter versus Danny the tiger.

00:13:49.198 --> 00:13:58.964
Anna understood now.

00:13:59.024 --> 00:14:01.666
Sam was a boxer.

00:14:01.726 --> 00:14:05.600
Dangerous fighter meant good boxer.

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:08.242
Sam was not a criminal.

00:14:08.302 --> 00:14:11.318
Anna followed Sam into the building.

00:14:11.377 --> 00:14:13.623
It was a very big hall.

00:14:13.683 --> 00:14:16.284
There were seats on all sides.

00:14:16.344 --> 00:14:19.216
In the middle was the boxing ring.

00:14:19.276 --> 00:14:22.128
Tino and Bubs were waiting for them.

00:14:22.188 --> 00:14:25.199
Stay here, Anna, said Sam.

00:14:25.259 --> 00:14:27.760
Tino and Bubs will look after you.

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:29.890
I must go now.

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:33.901
Tino and Bob's shook Sam's hand.

00:14:33.961 --> 00:14:36.001
Good luck, Sam.

00:14:36.061 --> 00:14:37.352
Said Bob's.

00:14:37.412 --> 00:14:40.692
You'll win all right, said Tino.

00:14:40.752 --> 00:14:44.243
Anna smiled at Sam for the first time.

00:14:44.303 --> 00:14:48.304
Good luck, Sam, she said.

00:14:48.364 --> 00:14:53.205
Tino and Bob's took Anna to a seat beside the ring.

00:14:53.265 --> 00:14:57.916
Tino sat on one side of her and Bob's on the other.

00:14:57.976 --> 00:15:00.574
Anna sat quietly and waited.

00:15:00.634 --> 00:15:04.684
The two men talked excitedly.

00:15:04.744 --> 00:15:08.908
Sam's going to win, said Tino.

00:15:08.968 --> 00:15:10.789
Of course he'll win.

00:15:10.849 --> 00:15:11.930
Said Bob's.

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:14.802
He's the best fighter in the country.

00:15:14.862 --> 00:15:16.404
Anna listened.

00:15:16.464 --> 00:15:18.776
Sam was famous.

00:15:18.836 --> 00:15:22.173
Everybody wants him to win, said Tino.

00:15:22.233 --> 00:15:23.909
Everybody likes him.

00:15:23.969 --> 00:15:26.500
That's right, said Bob's.

00:15:26.560 --> 00:15:31.364
Sam's a great boxer, and he's a good man too.

00:15:31.424 --> 00:15:35.075
I know a story about Sam, said Tino.

00:15:35.136 --> 00:15:38.368
One night he was asleep in bed.

00:15:38.428 --> 00:15:42.120
He heard shouts in the street and he looked outside.

00:15:42.180 --> 00:15:44.141
A house was on fire.

00:15:44.201 --> 00:15:45.922
He ran outside.

00:15:45.982 --> 00:15:48.892
There was a child in the burning house.

00:15:48.952 --> 00:15:54.592
He went inside and saved the child, but he was badly hurt.

00:15:54.652 --> 00:15:58.552
His face was burned, and he got a bad scar.

00:15:58.612 --> 00:16:01.313
Poor Sam, said Bubs.

00:16:01.373 --> 00:16:03.674
That's why he's so ugly.

00:16:03.734 --> 00:16:05.834
They both laughed.

00:16:05.894 --> 00:16:08.365
Anna was listening quietly.

00:16:08.425 --> 00:16:10.996
She now understood everything.

00:16:11.056 --> 00:16:13.236
She was safe with Sam.

00:16:13.296 --> 00:16:15.727
She felt sorry for him.

00:16:15.787 --> 00:16:18.498
Is the fight going to start soon?

00:16:18.558 --> 00:16:20.020
She asked Tino.

00:16:20.079 --> 00:16:22.702
Yes, of course, said Tino.

00:16:22.762 --> 00:16:25.684
It will start very soon.

00:16:25.743 --> 00:16:29.186
The hall was full of people now.

00:16:29.246 --> 00:16:31.998
Boys were selling cigarettes and sweets.

00:16:32.058 --> 00:16:34.660
Everybody was laughing and joking.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:37.352
The referee was waiting in the ring.

00:16:37.412 --> 00:16:40.124
The audience was excited now.

00:16:40.184 --> 00:16:41.425
Sam!

00:16:41.485 --> 00:16:42.395
Sam!

00:16:42.455 --> 00:16:45.120
We want Sam, they shouted.

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:47.643
Sam climbed into the ring.

00:16:47.703 --> 00:16:52.215
He was wearing short trousers and big boxing gloves.

00:16:52.275 --> 00:16:56.157
He raised both hands in the air.

00:16:56.217 --> 00:16:59.389
The crowd was clapping.

00:16:59.449 --> 00:17:00.559
Sam!

00:17:00.619 --> 00:17:01.510
Sam!

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:02.490
Sam!

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:03.681
They shouted.

00:17:03.741 --> 00:17:06.472
The other fighter climbed into the ring.

00:17:06.532 --> 00:17:09.044
He was very big and strong.

00:17:09.103 --> 00:17:12.065
Here comes Danny, said Tino.

00:17:12.125 --> 00:17:14.642
He's a very good fighter.

00:17:14.702 --> 00:17:16.787
Anna was worried.

00:17:16.848 --> 00:17:19.638
Don't you worry, Anna?

00:17:19.698 --> 00:17:20.948
Said Bob's.

00:17:21.008 --> 00:17:24.429
Sam's the best fighter in the country.

00:17:24.489 --> 00:17:28.870
The referee called the two boxers to the center of the ring.

00:17:28.930 --> 00:17:32.011
He spoke to them quietly for a few moments.

00:17:32.071 --> 00:17:35.102
Then Sam and Danny shook hands.

00:17:35.162 --> 00:17:39.623
The two fighters went back to their corners and waited.

00:17:39.683 --> 00:17:46.473
A bell rang and the fight began.

00:17:46.533 --> 00:17:53.956
Danny was younger than Sam, but he was a good fighter.

00:17:54.017 --> 00:17:55.828
He moved fast.

00:17:55.888 --> 00:18:00.482
He tried to hit Sam, but Sam jumped away every time.

00:18:00.542 --> 00:18:02.714
Sam's arms were long.

00:18:02.774 --> 00:18:04.696
He moved very quickly.

00:18:04.756 --> 00:18:08.560
He hit Danny hard many times.

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:11.784
Hannah was very excited.

00:18:11.844 --> 00:18:14.779
Her hands held the seat tightly.

00:18:14.839 --> 00:18:16.972
It was a long fight.

00:18:17.032 --> 00:18:19.073
Sam moved quickly.

00:18:19.133 --> 00:18:20.994
He hit Danny often.

00:18:21.054 --> 00:18:24.014
But Danny did not fall down.

00:18:24.074 --> 00:18:26.515
Sam was getting tired.

00:18:26.575 --> 00:18:28.916
He was moving more slowly.

00:18:28.976 --> 00:18:30.816
Anna was worried.

00:18:30.876 --> 00:18:32.617
The crowd was shouting.

00:18:32.677 --> 00:18:33.607
Sam!

00:18:33.667 --> 00:18:34.908
Sam!

00:18:34.968 --> 00:18:36.378
Anna shouted.

00:18:36.438 --> 00:18:37.448
Sam!

00:18:37.508 --> 00:18:38.108
Sam!

00:18:38.168 --> 00:18:39.659
Come on, Sam!

00:18:39.719 --> 00:18:41.219
Watch out!

00:18:41.279 --> 00:18:44.060
Tino and Pubs were shouting too.

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:47.004
Danny hit Sam's face hard.

00:18:47.064 --> 00:18:52.328
Blood came out of Sam's nose and one of his eyes was nearly closed.

00:18:52.388 --> 00:18:54.650
But Sam did not stop.

00:18:54.710 --> 00:19:00.606
He ran forward and hit Danny with all his strength.

00:19:00.666 --> 00:19:04.849
Danny fell over and lay still.

00:19:04.909 --> 00:19:07.562
The referee started to count.

00:19:07.622 --> 00:19:12.042
One, two, three.

00:19:12.102 --> 00:19:13.418
Four.

00:19:13.478 --> 00:19:15.160
Danny did not move.

00:19:15.220 --> 00:19:16.480
Five.

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:17.861
Six.

00:19:17.921 --> 00:19:19.132
Seven.

00:19:19.192 --> 00:19:20.643
Danny tried to get up.

00:19:20.703 --> 00:19:21.923
He could not.

00:19:21.984 --> 00:19:23.114
Eight.

00:19:23.174 --> 00:19:24.495
Nine.

00:19:24.555 --> 00:19:26.887
Ten.

00:19:26.947 --> 00:19:29.868
Danny lay still.

00:19:29.928 --> 00:19:32.050
The fight was over.

00:19:32.110 --> 00:19:34.405
Sam was the winner.

00:19:34.465 --> 00:19:37.682
Anna was laughing and clapping.

00:19:37.742 --> 00:19:39.793
Well done, Sam!

00:19:39.853 --> 00:19:41.544
Well done, Sam!

00:19:41.604 --> 00:19:42.705
She shouted.

00:19:42.765 --> 00:19:44.346
Nobody heard her.

00:19:44.406 --> 00:19:46.138
Everybody was shouting.

00:19:46.198 --> 00:19:47.158
Sam!

00:19:47.218 --> 00:19:48.520
We want Sam!

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:53.029
We want Sam!

00:19:53.089 --> 00:19:59.218
Tino and Bobs took Anna to the dressing room.

00:19:59.278 --> 00:20:01.168
Sam was resting.

00:20:01.228 --> 00:20:02.878
Hello, Sam.

00:20:02.938 --> 00:20:04.439
Said Anna.

00:20:04.499 --> 00:20:06.600
You were great.

00:20:06.660 --> 00:20:08.750
Sam was surprised.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:10.260
Hello, Anna.

00:20:10.320 --> 00:20:13.491
He said, you're different now.

00:20:13.551 --> 00:20:17.041
You didn't talk to me before.

00:20:17.102 --> 00:20:20.012
I'm sorry, Sam.

00:20:20.072 --> 00:20:21.303
Said Anna.

00:20:21.363 --> 00:20:24.024
I was frightened.

00:20:24.084 --> 00:20:25.274
I know.

00:20:25.334 --> 00:20:26.710
Said Sam.

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:31.088
I'm big and ugly, and you were frightened.

00:20:31.148 --> 00:20:33.770
But I'm not a criminal, Anna.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:36.001
I'm sorry, Sam.

00:20:36.061 --> 00:20:37.842
Anna said again.

00:20:37.902 --> 00:20:39.933
I was wrong.

00:20:39.994 --> 00:20:42.535
I'm not frightened now.

00:20:42.595 --> 00:20:44.606
Sam was pleased.

00:20:44.666 --> 00:20:46.037
Come on, Anna.

00:20:46.097 --> 00:20:49.219
He said, we'll go to Nara now.

00:20:49.279 --> 00:20:51.606
Your aunt is waiting for you.

00:20:51.666 --> 00:20:54.735
Anna said goodbye to Tino and Bubs.

00:20:54.795 --> 00:20:57.347
She got into a taxi with Sam.

00:20:57.407 --> 00:21:02.661
It was a long way to Nara, and Anna asked Sam many questions.

00:21:02.721 --> 00:21:06.264
They talked and talked and talked.

00:21:06.324 --> 00:21:08.706
They reached Nara at night.

00:21:08.766 --> 00:21:10.256
It was dark.

00:21:10.317 --> 00:21:12.148
Sam knew Nara.

00:21:12.208 --> 00:21:15.370
He quickly found Anna's aunt's house.

00:21:15.431 --> 00:21:17.242
They knocked on the door.

00:21:17.302 --> 00:21:19.001
The door opened.

00:21:19.061 --> 00:21:21.882
Anna's aunt was standing in the doorway.

00:21:21.942 --> 00:21:23.974
She was crying.

00:21:24.034 --> 00:21:25.896
Oh, Anna!

00:21:25.956 --> 00:21:26.866
Anna!

00:21:26.926 --> 00:21:30.670
She said, thank God you are here at last!

00:21:30.731 --> 00:21:32.852
Then she saw Sam.

00:21:32.913 --> 00:21:35.164
He looked terrible.

00:21:35.224 --> 00:21:38.938
His face was cut and bruised after the fight.

00:21:38.999 --> 00:21:40.090
Anna!

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:43.182
She said, who is this man?

00:21:43.242 --> 00:21:47.193
Auntie, Anna said, don't be angry.

00:21:47.213 --> 00:21:49.164
This is Sam.

00:21:49.224 --> 00:21:51.414
I fell asleep on the train.

00:21:51.474 --> 00:21:54.076
I passed Nara station.

00:21:54.136 --> 00:21:56.046
Sam helped me.

00:21:56.106 --> 00:21:58.028
He took me to a hotel.

00:21:58.088 --> 00:22:01.069
He brought me to Nara in a taxi.

00:22:01.129 --> 00:22:04.440
Anna's aunt looked at Sam again.

00:22:04.500 --> 00:22:06.092
Wait a minute.

00:22:06.152 --> 00:22:07.363
She said.

00:22:07.423 --> 00:22:09.284
She ran inside.

00:22:09.344 --> 00:22:11.747
She came back with a newspaper.

00:22:11.807 --> 00:22:15.931
Sam's photograph was on the back page.

00:22:15.991 --> 00:22:19.214
Are you Sam the boxer?

00:22:19.274 --> 00:22:20.425
She asked.

00:22:20.485 --> 00:22:22.066
Yes, I am.

00:22:22.126 --> 00:22:23.498
Said Sam.

00:22:23.558 --> 00:22:25.860
Anna's aunt was pleased.

00:22:25.920 --> 00:22:27.622
Sam was famous.

00:22:27.682 --> 00:22:29.544
He was a great man.

00:22:29.604 --> 00:22:31.728
Everybody knew him.

00:22:31.788 --> 00:22:34.912
Come in, Sam," she said.

00:22:34.972 --> 00:22:37.074
Please sit down.

00:22:37.134 --> 00:22:39.386
Will you have some tea?

00:22:39.446 --> 00:22:43.030
Anna sat in the room with her aunt and Sam.

00:22:43.090 --> 00:22:45.262
She did not say anything.

00:22:45.322 --> 00:22:47.934
She felt very happy.

00:22:47.994 --> 00:22:51.368
Anna's aunt asked Sam many questions.

00:22:51.428 --> 00:22:53.069
She laughed a lot.

00:22:53.129 --> 00:22:55.271
She liked him.

00:22:55.332 --> 00:22:58.184
It was getting very late.

00:22:58.244 --> 00:23:01.496
I must go now, Anna, said Sam.

00:23:01.556 --> 00:23:03.988
Can I come and see you again?

00:23:04.048 --> 00:23:07.150
Yes, Sam, said Anna.

00:23:07.210 --> 00:23:24.332
She smiled at him.

00:23:24.392 --> 00:23:48.818
Anna and the Fighter was read by Kate Harper and the recording produced by James Richardson at Studio AVP London.

